  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till IWPR (War Crimes Tribunal Monitoring Project) i det forna Jugoslavien. Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let med projektet &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka regional och internationell f&#xF6;rst&#xE5;else och st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r International Criminal Tribunals arbete med att &#xE5;tala krigsf&#xF6;rbrytare fr&#xE5;n forna Jugoslavien. Svenskt st&#xF6;d genom Sida omfattar h&#xF6;gst SEK 750 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the IWPR- War Crimes Tribunal Monitoring Project in the former Yugoslavia. The overall objective is to raice regional and international understanding and support for the International Criminal Tribunal&apos;s aim to prosecute war criminals from the forner Yugoslavia. The Swedish contribution amounts to SEK 750 000.</narrative>
  </description>
